  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It is very difficult to tell when you load the game if gesture lock is enabled. Resulting in it looking as if the controllers, game, or avatar has stopped functioning properly.\nFor example perhaps the icon could persist similar to the desktop V for voice chat to alert users, or maybe default behaviour should be disable on game start (with an option in the menu for players to change it if they want). \nAdmittedly this is a rare issue but I have encountered it enough times with myself and others regarding taking time to troubleshoot why the controllers appear to have stopped working in game when it just happens to be the gesture lock stuck in the default pose without any indication that gesture lock was enabled.",
